msgstr "Masquer/afficher le menu."

#: includes/settings/functions.php:58
msgid "MENU"
msgstr "MENU"

#: includes/settings/help.php:102
msgid ""
"When an audio cannot be downloaded, its %s tag is removed from the content "
"instead of pointing at the source site."
msgstr ""
"Quand un son ne peut pas être téléchargé, sa balise %s est retirée du "
"contenu au lieu de pointer vers le site d’origine."

#: includes/settings/help.php:104
msgid "If the audio sits inside an %s tag, that link is removed as well."
msgstr "Si le son se trouve dans une balise %s, ce lien est retiré également."

#: includes/settings/help.php:109
msgid "Turn it off if the audios stop playing."
msgstr "Désactivez-le si les sons ne se lisent plus."

#: includes/settings/help.php:114
msgid "Global settings for videos"
msgstr "Réglages généraux des vidéos"

#: includes/settings/help.php:120
msgid ""
"A copy of every video found in the feed item (only in %s tags) is saved to "
"your Uploads folder. Off, videos stay on the source server."
msgstr ""
"Une copie de chaque vidéo de l’élément du flux (uniquement dans les balises "
"%s) est enregistrée dans votre dossier de téléversements. Désactivé, les "
"vidéos restent sur le serveur d’origine."

#: includes/settings/help.php:121
msgid ""
"Video files are heavy: storing them locally fills your disk fast. Each "
"campaign can set this on its own."
msgstr ""
"Les vidéos sont lourdes : les stocker localement remplit vite votre disque. "
"Chaque campagne peut en décider elle-même."

#: includes/settings/help.php:125
msgid ""
"Every downloaded video is added to the Media library and attached to its "
"post."
msgstr ""
"Chaque vidéo téléchargée est ajoutée à la médiathèque et attachée à son "
"article."

#: includes/settings/help.php:131
msgid ""
"When a video cannot be downloaded, its %s tag is removed from the content "
"instead of pointing at the source site."
msgstr ""
"Quand une vidéo ne peut pas être téléchargée, sa balise %s est retirée du "
"contenu au lieu de pointer vers le site d’origine."

#: includes/settings/help.php:133
msgid "If the video sits inside an %s tag, that link is removed as well."
msgstr ""
"Si la vidéo se trouve dans une balise %s, ce lien est retiré également."

#: includes/settings/help.php:138
msgid "Turn it off if the videos stop playing."
msgstr "Désactivez-le si les vidéos ne se lisent plus."

#: includes/settings/help.php:143
msgid "Enable features"
msgstr "Activer des fonctions"

#: includes/settings/help.php:144
msgid ""
"Each one adds its own box to every campaign. Leave off what you do not use."
msgstr ""
"Chacune ajoute sa propre boîte à toutes les campagnes. Laissez désactivé ce "
"que vous n’utilisez pas."

#: includes/settings/help.php:152
msgid ""
"Replaces a word or phrase with another one in the content of every post."
msgstr ""
"Remplace un mot ou une phrase par un autre dans le contenu de chaque article."

#: includes/settings/help.php:155
msgid "Vimeo campaign type"
msgstr "Type de campagne Vimeo"

#: includes/settings/help.php:156
msgid ""
"Adds Vimeo to the campaign type list, to publish the videos of a Vimeo user, "
"channel or group. Paste the address and the campaign finds its feed on its "
"own."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute Vimeo à la liste des types de campagne, pour publier les vidéos d’un "
"utilisateur, d’une chaîne ou d’un groupe Vimeo. Collez l’adresse et la "
"campagne trouve son flux toute seule."

#: includes/settings/help.php:157
msgid ""
"Vimeo publishes the last 10 videos of each one. Leave this off if you do not "
"use Vimeo: the campaign type is not loaded at all."
msgstr ""
"Vimeo publie les 10 dernières vidéos de chacun. Laissez ceci désactivé si "
"vous n'utilisez pas Vimeo : le type de campagne n'est alors pas chargé du "
"tout."

#: includes/settings/help.php:160 includes/settings/page.php:737
msgid "Canonical URL to the source"
msgstr "URL canonique vers la source"

#: includes/settings/help.php:161
msgid ""
"Each imported post declares the original article as its canonical URL. It "
"does not work on every server."
msgstr ""
"Chaque article importé déclare l’article d’origine comme son URL canonique. "
"Cela ne fonctionne pas sur tous les serveurs."

#: includes/settings/help.php:162
msgid ""
"This tells search engines which copy of the article is the one to index, so "
"your site is not penalised for duplicated content."
msgstr ""
"Cela indique aux moteurs de recherche quelle copie de l’article indexer, "
"pour que votre site ne soit pas pénalisé pour contenu dupliqué."

#: includes/settings/help.php:167
msgid "Force the bundled SimplePie library"
msgstr "Forcer la bibliothèque SimplePie fournie"

#: includes/settings/help.php:168
msgid ""
"Ignores the SimplePie that ships with WordPress. You only need this if that "
"version gives you trouble."
msgstr ""
"Ignore la SimplePie livrée avec WordPress. Vous n’en avez besoin que si "
"cette version vous pose problème."

#: includes/settings/help.php:171 includes/settings/page.php:428
msgid "Set SimplePie \"stupidly fast\""
msgstr "Mettre SimplePie en « stupidly fast »"

#: includes/settings/help.php:172
msgid ""
"SimplePie gives up most of its sanitizing in exchange for speed: the feed "
"content arrives with no parsers and no filters."
msgstr ""
"SimplePie renonce à l’essentiel de son nettoyage au profit de la vitesse : "
"le contenu du flux arrive sans analyseurs ni filtres."

#: includes/settings/help.php:173
msgid ""
"Nothing is stripped from the content: all HTML, styles and scripts come "
"through. Use it only with feeds you trust; otherwise set the allowed tags "
"and attributes below."
msgstr ""
"Rien n’est retiré du contenu : tout le HTML, les styles et les scripts "
"passent. À n’utiliser qu’avec des flux de confiance ; sinon, réglez ci-"
"dessous les balises et attributs autorisés."

#: includes/settings/help.php:176 includes/settings/page.php:436
msgid "HTML tags SimplePie strips"
msgstr "Balises HTML retirées par SimplePie"

#: includes/settings/help.php:177
msgid ""
"SimplePie removes these tags from the feed content. Take one out to let it "
"through, for example iframe to keep embedded videos."
msgstr ""
"SimplePie retire ces balises du contenu du flux. Retirez-en une de la liste "
"pour la laisser passer, par exemple iframe pour garder les vidéos intégrées."

#: includes/settings/help.php:180 includes/settings/page.php:446
msgid "HTML attributes SimplePie strips"
msgstr "Attributs HTML retirés par SimplePie"

#: includes/settings/help.php:181
msgid ""
"SimplePie removes these attributes from the tags in the content. Take one "
"out to keep it, or add more to strip."
msgstr ""
"SimplePie retire aussi ces attributs des balises du contenu. Retirez-en un "
"pour le garder, ou ajoutez-en d’autres."

#: includes/settings/help.php:186 includes/settings/page.php:470
msgid "Let campaigns skip the content filters"
msgstr "Permettre aux campagnes d’ignorer les filtres de contenu"

#: includes/settings/help.php:187
msgid ""
"Adds a switch to every campaign that stores the feed content exactly as it "
"comes, scripts included. Use it only with sources you trust."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute à chaque campagne un interrupteur qui enregistre le contenu du flux "
"exactement tel qu’il arrive, scripts compris. À n’utiliser qu’avec des "
"sources de confiance."

#: includes/settings/help.php:188
msgid ""
"WordPress inserts the post as usual and the content is then written straight "
"to the database, past every filter."
msgstr ""
"WordPress insère l’article comme d’habitude, puis le contenu est écrit "
"directement en base de données, hors de tout filtre."

#: includes/settings/help.php:189
msgid "See How WordPress Processes Post Content: "
msgstr "Voir « How WordPress Processes Post Content » : "

#: includes/settings/help.php:192
msgid "Timeout for a running campaign"
msgstr "Délai pour une campagne en cours"

#: includes/settings/help.php:193
msgid ""
"A campaign interrupted halfway stays marked as running until this many "
"seconds have passed; then it runs again on its next schedule. Recommended: "
"300."
msgstr ""
"Une campagne interrompue en cours de route reste marquée comme en cours "
"pendant ce nombre de secondes ; elle repart ensuite à sa prochaine "
"planification. Recommandé : 300."

#: includes/settings/help.php:194
msgid "Set 0 to keep it blocked until you click \"Clear campaign\" yourself."
msgstr ""
"Mettez 0 pour qu’elle reste bloquée jusqu’à ce que vous cliquiez vous-même "
"sur « Libérer la campagne »."

#: includes/settings/help.php:197
msgid "Pause after every post"
msgstr "Pause après chaque article"

#: includes/settings/help.php:198
msgid ""
"Waits this many seconds after inserting each post, to give the server a "
"break on long runs. Leave 0 unless you have trouble."
msgstr ""
"Attend ce nombre de secondes après l’insertion de chaque article, pour "
"laisser souffler le serveur sur les longues exécutions. Laissez 0 sauf en "
"cas de problème."

#: includes/settings/help.php:204
msgid ""
"To publish items that share a title, use \"Allow duplicate titles\" instead "
"and leave the hash check on."
msgstr ""
"Pour publier des éléments qui partagent un titre, utilisez plutôt "
"« Autoriser les titres en double » et laissez le contrôle par hachage actif."

#: includes/settings/help.php:213 includes/settings/page.php:544
msgid "Do not save the plugin custom fields"
msgstr "Ne pas enregistrer les champs personnalisés de l’extension"

#: includes/settings/help.php:214
msgid ""
"Saves database space and costs you the source permalink, the campaign each "
"post came from and every bulk action based on it."
msgstr ""
"Économise de l’espace en base et vous coûte le permalien d’origine, la "
"campagne dont vient chaque article et toute action groupée qui s’appuie "
"dessus."

#: includes/settings/help.php:215
msgid ""
"By default each published post carries three custom fields with the campaign "
"and the source item. Turning this on does not delete the ones already saved."
msgstr ""
"Par défaut, chaque article publié porte trois champs personnalisés avec la "
"campagne et l’élément source. Activer ceci n’efface pas ceux déjà "
"enregistrés."

#: includes/settings/help.php:224 includes/settings/page.php:573
msgid "Disable WPeMatico schedules"
msgstr "Désactiver les planifications de WPeMatico"

#: includes/settings/help.php:225
msgid ""
"No campaign runs on its own any more. You run them by hand or from an "
"external cron, which is the recommended setup."
msgstr ""
"Plus aucune campagne ne s’exécute seule. Vous les lancez à la main ou depuis "
"un cron externe, ce qui est recommandé."

#: includes/settings/help.php:228 includes/settings/page.php:607
msgid "Ask for a password on the external cron"
msgstr "Demander un mot de passe pour le cron externe"

#: includes/settings/help.php:229
msgid ""
"Only a request carrying the code runs your campaigns. Off by default for "
"backward compatibility, and strongly recommended."
msgstr ""
"Seule une requête portant le code exécute vos campagnes. Désactivé par "
"défaut par compatibilité, et fortement recommandé."

#: includes/settings/help.php:230
msgid "While this is off, the password below is ignored."
msgstr "Tant que ceci est désactivé, le mot de passe ci-dessous est ignoré."

#: includes/settings/help.php:233
msgid "External cron password"
msgstr "Mot de passe du cron externe"

#: includes/settings/help.php:234
msgid "Any text you like. It travels in the cron address as ?code=your_code."
msgstr ""
"Le texte que vous voulez. Il voyage dans l’adresse du cron sous la forme ?"
"code=votre_code."

#: includes/settings/help.php:237 includes/settings/page.php:627
msgid "Disable all WP_Cron"
msgstr "Désactiver tout WP_Cron"

#: includes/settings/help.php:238
msgid ""
"Stops every scheduled task on the site, WordPress own and other plugins "
"included. Only do this if an external cron takes over."
msgstr ""
"Arrête toutes les tâches planifiées du site, celles de WordPress et des "
"autres extensions comprises. Ne le faites que si un cron externe prend le "
"relais."

#: includes/settings/help.php:24
msgid "Global settings for images"
msgstr "Réglages généraux des images"

#: includes/settings/help.php:241 includes/settings/page.php:564
msgid "Use ALTERNATE_WP_CRON"
msgstr "Utiliser ALTERNATE_WP_CRON"

#: includes/settings/help.php:242
msgid ""
"Some servers block the way WordPress triggers its schedules. This constant "
"works around it on almost any server."
msgstr ""
"Certains serveurs bloquent la façon dont WordPress déclenche ses "
"planifications. Cette constante contourne le problème sur presque tous les "
"serveurs."

#: includes/settings/help.php:245 includes/settings/page.php:657
msgid "Log file for the external cron"
msgstr "Fichier journal du cron externe"

#: includes/settings/help.php:246
msgid ""
"Writes a \"campaign title.txt.log\" file in the uploads folder with the "
"steps of each external cron run. Useful while you set the cron up."
msgstr ""
"Écrit un fichier « titre de la campagne.txt.log » dans le dossier des "
"téléversements avec les étapes de chaque exécution du cron externe. Utile "
"pendant la mise en place."

#: includes/settings/help.php:25 includes/settings/help.php:86
#: includes/settings/help.php:115
msgid "These apply to every campaign, and each campaign can override them."
msgstr ""
"Ils s’appliquent à toutes les campagnes, et chaque campagne peut les "
"remplacer."

#: includes/settings/help.php:251 includes/settings/page.php:896
msgid "Campaign column in the posts lists"
msgstr "Colonne de campagne dans les listes d’articles"

#: includes/settings/help.php:252
msgid "Adds a column showing which campaign published each post."
msgstr "Ajoute une colonne indiquant quelle campagne a publié chaque article."

#: includes/settings/help.php:255 includes/settings/page.php:903
msgid "Position of that column"
msgstr "Position de cette colonne"

#: includes/settings/help.php:256
msgid "Where the campaign column sits among the others."
msgstr "Où se place la colonne de campagne parmi les autres."

#: includes/settings/help.php:259 includes/settings/page.php:916
msgid "Hide the campaign box in the post editor"
msgstr "Masquer la boîte de campagne dans l’éditeur d’article"

#: includes/settings/help.php:260
msgid "Removes the WPeMatico box that shows where an imported post came from."
msgstr "Retire la boîte WPeMatico qui indique d’où vient un article importé."

#: includes/settings/help.php:263 includes/settings/page.php:925
msgid "Empty trash button on the lists"
msgstr "Bouton « Vider la corbeille » dans les listes"

#: includes/settings/help.php:264
msgid "Adds a button to empty the trash on the post types you choose."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute un bouton pour vider la corbeille sur les types de contenu que vous "
"choisissez."

#: includes/settings/help.php:267 includes/settings/page.php:966
msgid "Hide the WP dashboard widget"
msgstr "Masquer le widget du tableau de bord"

#: includes/settings/help.php:268
msgid "Removes the WPeMatico widget from the WordPress dashboard."
msgstr "Retire le widget WPeMatico du tableau de bord de WordPress."

#: includes/settings/help.php:273 includes/settings/page.php:757
msgid "Do not check feeds before saving"
msgstr "Ne pas vérifier les flux avant d’enregistrer"

#: includes/settings/help.php:274
msgid ""
"Saving a campaign no longer tests each feed address first. The campaign "
"saves faster and a broken address goes unnoticed until it runs."
msgstr ""
"L’enregistrement d’une campagne ne teste plus chaque adresse de flux. La "
"campagne s’enregistre plus vite, et une adresse cassée passe inaperçue "
"jusqu’à l’exécution."

#: includes/settings/help.php:277 includes/settings/page.php:766
msgid "Enable \"Del hash\""
msgstr "Activer « Effacer le hachage »"

#: includes/settings/help.php:278
msgid ""
"Adds a link on the campaigns list that clears the duplicate hashes of every "
"feed in a campaign, so its items can be published again."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute dans la liste des campagnes un lien qui efface les hachages de "
"doublons de tous les flux d’une campagne, pour que ses éléments puissent "
"être republiés."

#: includes/settings/help.php:281 includes/settings/page.php:775
msgid "Enable \"See last log\""
msgstr "Activer « Voir le dernier journal »"

#: includes/settings/help.php:282
msgid "Adds a link on the campaigns list that opens the log of the last run."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute dans la liste des campagnes un lien qui ouvre le journal de la "
"dernière exécution."

#: includes/settings/help.php:285 includes/settings/page.php:793
msgid "Hide the WPeMatico credits"
msgstr "Masquer les crédits de WPeMatico"

#: includes/settings/help.php:286
msgid "I would really appreciate you leaving the credits on."
msgstr "J’apprécierais beaucoup que vous laissiez les crédits affichés."

#: includes/settings/help.php:288 includes/settings/page.php:800
msgid ""
"If you cannot show them, a minute of your time to %1$s write a 5 star review "
"on WordPress %2$s means just as much. :-) Thanks."
msgstr ""
"Si vous ne pouvez pas les montrer, une minute de votre temps pour %1$s "
"écrire un avis 5 étoiles sur WordPress %2$s vaut tout autant. :-) Merci."

#: includes/settings/help.php:293 includes/settings/page.php:811
msgid "No description on auto categories"
msgstr "Pas de description sur les catégories automatiques"

#: includes/settings/help.php:294
msgid ""
"Categories created from now on are left without the \"Created by WPeMatico\" "
"description. The ones already created keep theirs until you edit them."
msgstr ""
"Les catégories créées à partir de maintenant restent sans la description "
"« Created by WPeMatico ». Celles déjà créées gardent la leur jusqu’à ce que "
"vous les modifiiez."

#: includes/settings/help.php:297 includes/settings/page.php:821
msgid "Do not load the Extensions page"
msgstr "Ne pas charger la page Extensions"

#: includes/settings/help.php:298
msgid "The Extensions menu stops asking our site for the add-on catalogue."
msgstr "Le menu Extensions cesse de demander le catalogue à notre site."

#: includes/settings/help.php:299
msgid ""
"You will see an empty page, or only the extensions you already have "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"Vous verrez une page vide, ou seulement les extensions déjà installées."

#: includes/settings/help.php:30
msgid ""
"A copy of every image found in the feed item (only in %s tags) is saved to "
"your Uploads folder. Off, images stay on the source server."
msgstr ""
"Une copie de chaque image de l’élément du flux (uniquement dans les balises "
"%s) est enregistrée dans votre dossier de téléversements. Désactivé, les "
"images restent sur le serveur d’origine."

#: includes/settings/help.php:302 includes/settings/page.php:784
msgid "Enable XML uploads"
msgstr "Autoriser le téléversement de XML"

#: includes/settings/help.php:303
msgid ""
"Lets you upload XML files to the Media library, to use them in an XML "
"campaign."
msgstr ""
"Vous permet de téléverser des fichiers XML dans la médiathèque, pour les "
"utiliser dans une campagne XML."

#: includes/settings/help.php:306 includes/settings/page.php:830
msgid "Decode HTML entities on publish"
msgstr "Décoder les entités HTML à la publication"

#: includes/settings/help.php:307
msgid ""
"Turns entities such as &amp;amp; back into their character before the post "
"is saved. Useful with feeds that encode the content twice."
msgstr ""
"Transforme les entités comme &amp;amp; en leur caractère avant "
"l’enregistrement de l’article. Utile avec les flux qui encodent le contenu "
"deux fois."

#: includes/settings/help.php:31
msgid ""
"Linking to the source server saves space and makes your pages faster, but "
"you lose the image the day the source removes it. Each campaign can set this "
"on its own."
msgstr ""
"Pointer vers le serveur d’origine économise de l’espace et accélère vos "
"pages, mais vous perdez l’image le jour où la source la supprime. Chaque "
"campagne peut en décider elle-même."

#: includes/settings/help.php:312
msgid "Sender email"
msgstr "E-mail de l’expéditeur"

#: includes/settings/help.php:313
msgid "The address every email from this plugin is sent from."
msgstr "L’adresse depuis laquelle part chaque e-mail de cette extension."

#: includes/settings/help.php:316
msgid "Sender name"
msgstr "Nom de l’expéditeur"

#: includes/settings/help.php:317
msgid "The name shown next to that address in your inbox."
msgstr "Le nom affiché à côté de cette adresse dans votre boîte de réception."

#: includes/settings/help.php:329
msgid "Features available with the Professional add-on."
msgstr "Fonctions disponibles avec l’extension Professional."

#: includes/settings/help.php:330
msgid ""
"Publish or skip an item depending on the keywords found in its title or "
"content."
msgstr ""
"Publier ou écarter un élément selon les mots-clés trouvés dans son titre ou "
"son contenu."

#: includes/settings/help.php:331
msgid ""
"Cut, publish or skip an item depending on how many words or letters its "
"content has."
msgstr ""
"Couper, publier ou écarter un élément selon le nombre de mots ou de lettres "
"de son contenu."

#: includes/settings/help.php:332
msgid ""
"Build the title of every post of a campaign from a template of your own."
msgstr ""
"Composer le titre de chaque article d’une campagne à partir d’un modèle à "
"vous."

#: includes/settings/help.php:333
msgid ""
"Generates the tags of every post automatically. Each campaign can turn that "
"off and use a list of tags you write instead."
msgstr ""
"Génère automatiquement les étiquettes de chaque article. Chaque campagne "
"peut désactiver cela et utiliser une liste d’étiquettes que vous écrivez."

#: includes/settings/help.php:334
msgid "Add custom fields, with template tags as their value, to every post."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute à chaque article des champs personnalisés dont la valeur est une "
"balise de modèle."

#: includes/settings/help.php:335
msgid ""
"Full Content is the add-on that fetches the whole article from the source "
"site when the feed only carries a summary."
msgstr ""
"Full Content est l’extension qui récupère l’article complet sur le site "
"source quand le flux ne porte qu’un résumé."

#: includes/settings/help.php:336
msgid ""
"Set an author per feed when editing a campaign. Feeds with no author of "
"their own use the campaign author."
msgstr ""
"Définir un auteur par flux lors de la modification d’une campagne. Les flux "
"sans auteur propre prennent l’auteur de la campagne."

#: includes/settings/help.php:337
msgid ""
"Paste a list of feed addresses, with or without author names, straight into "
"the campaign."
msgstr ""
"Collez une liste d’adresses de flux, avec ou sans noms d’auteur, directement "
"dans la campagne."

#: includes/settings/help.php:35
msgid ""
"Every downloaded image is added to the Media library and attached to its "
"post. Needed for the featured image."
msgstr ""
"Chaque image téléchargée est ajoutée à la médiathèque et attachée à son "
"article. Nécessaire pour l’image mise en avant."

#: includes/settings/help.php:36 includes/settings/help.php:97
#: includes/settings/help.php:126
msgid ""
"Turn it off if the run is too slow. It has no effect when custom upload is "
"on."
msgstr ""
"Désactivez-le si l’exécution est trop lente. Sans effet quand le "
"téléversement propre est actif."

#: includes/settings/help.php:41
msgid ""
"When an image cannot be downloaded, its %s tag is removed from the content "
"instead of pointing at the source site."
msgstr ""
"Quand une image ne peut pas être téléchargée, sa balise %s est retirée du "
"contenu au lieu de pointer vers le site d’origine."

#: includes/settings/help.php:43
msgid "If the image sits inside an %s tag, that link is removed as well."
msgstr "Si l’image se trouve dans une balise %s, ce lien est retiré également."

#: includes/settings/help.php:50
msgid "Images with no srcset attribute are processed as usual."
msgstr "Les images sans attribut srcset sont traitées comme d’habitude."

#: includes/settings/help.php:55
msgid "Post Thumbnails"
msgstr "Images à la une"

#: includes/settings/help.php:61
msgid ""
"With that plugin inactive, WPeMatico still writes its meta fields and "
"nothing else changes."
msgstr ""
"Si cette extension est inactive, WPeMatico enregistre quand même ses champs "
"meta et rien d’autre ne change."

#: includes/settings/help.php:65
msgid "The image used as featured is stripped from the post content."
msgstr ""
"L’image utilisée comme image mise en avant est retirée du contenu de "
"l’article."

#: includes/settings/help.php:66
msgid ""
"Useful when your theme already prints the featured image and you would "
"otherwise see it twice."
msgstr ""
"Utile quand votre thème affiche déjà l’image mise en avant et que vous la "
"verriez sinon deux fois."

#: includes/settings/help.php:71
msgid ""
"Turn it off if images stop appearing, or if you need WordPress to generate "
"all its image sizes. Generating them costs a lot of resources when many "
"images arrive at once."
msgstr ""
"Désactivez-le si les images n’apparaissent plus, ou si vous avez besoin que "
"WordPress génère toutes ses tailles d’image. Les générer coûte beaucoup de "
"ressources quand beaucoup d’images arrivent en même temps."

#: includes/settings/help.php:80
msgid ""
"It adds one query per image, so turn it off if the run is too slow. It does "
"not work on every server."
msgstr ""
"Cela ajoute une requête par image : désactivez-le si l’exécution est trop "
"lente. Cela ne fonctionne pas sur tous les serveurs."

#: includes/settings/help.php:85
msgid "Global settings for audios"
msgstr "Réglages généraux des sons"

#: includes/settings/help.php:91
msgid ""
