#~ msgid ""
#~ "Unless it is the first time, when finds a duplicate, it means that all "
#~ "following items were read before. This option avoids and allows jump "
#~ "every duplicate and continues reading the feed searching more new items. "
#~ "NOT RECOMMENDED."
