#~ msgid "How it works:"
#~ msgstr "Comment cela fonctionne :"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The feed items are ordered by datetime in almost all cases. When the "
#~ "campaign runs, goes item by item from newest to oldest, and stops when "
#~ "found the first duplicated item, this mean that all items following (the "
#~ "old ones) are also duplicated."
